.TH parsec-cli-shared-recovery 1  "shared-recovery " 
.SH NAME
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery \- Contains subcommands related to shared recovery devices (shamir)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBparsec\-cli shared\-recovery\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Contains subcommands related to shared recovery devices (shamir)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery\-create(1)
create shared recovery
.TP
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery\-list(1)
list shared recovery the user partakes in
.TP
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery\-delete(1)
delete shared recovery setup
.TP
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery\-info(1)
info about user\*(Aqs shared recovery setup
.TP
parsec\-cli\-shared\-recovery\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
